# aliases: led_deep_red deep-red-led
# Deep-red AlInGaP LED (horticulture / photography). Peak ~658 nm, matches the
# chlorophyll-a absorption peak. Measured single-die SPD (Brendel 2021); the real
# die has a steeper long-wavelength cutoff than a symmetric Gaussian.
# CIE 1931 xy=(0.716,0.278). See data/light/measured/led-deep-red.csv for source.
spd file:data/light/measured/led-deep-red.csv
